  "name": "The Office Lounge",
  "description": "Whether you're a long haul trucker, a tax attorney, or a short order cook, a long hard day at the office is the same for everybody. That's when it's time to step into our office - The Office Lounge! For years, we've been the place for folks from all walks of life in Foley, AL to relax and unwind over a pitcher of beer, a glass of wine or a cocktail. Tune into the game or dance the night away to Baldwin County's hottest bands on weekends. It's all going on at The Office Lounge. The Office Lounge is a labor of love. A love of good times and good music is how we came to be. Years later, The Office Lounge is still the place where local talent shines, with karaoke every Wednesday night and live bands on Saturdays. The only thing missing is you.",
